nd cream.<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, I like this nice, large seat.<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Flight Attendant</span>: You can recline it back to sleep.", "id": 2, "time": "4500", "image": "engenn3le09ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Vanessa</span>: Wow! Can I have a soda, please?<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Flight Attendant</span>: Certainly. All drinks and snacks are free.<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Miss, would you bring me another soda and a snack, please?<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Flight Attendant</span>: Of course! Meals are coming soon.", "id": 3, "time": "20300", "image": "engenn3le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Flight Attendant</span>: Fish or chicken?<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'd like to have the fish, please. Real plates and silverware! Can I have some coffee, please?<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Flight Attendant</span>: Here you go. Enjoy your meal!<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I could really get used to traveling like this!", "id": 4, "time": "51000", "image": "engenn3le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le09ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "At the Airport", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "First Class Ticket", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics fo