ss=\"italic\">would</span>  to make polite requests when you are on an airplane.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Modal Verb </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Polite Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Can I have some coffee, please? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you bring me some water? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Would you get me a snack, please? </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Traveler</span>: Can I have some coffee, please?  <br> <span class =\"strong\">Flight Attendant</span>: Of course. <br> ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Traveler</span>: Would you get me a snack, please? <br> <span class =\"strong\">Flight Attendant</span>: Certainly.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "silverware ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "knives, forks and spoons; cuttlery", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In first class, they use real silverware, not plastic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear when you fly first class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "eye mask ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a dark cloth to cover your eyes when sleeping ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is an eye mask in here for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hand cream", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thick liquid to put on dry hands  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need some hand cream. My hands are very dry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to welcome ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to greet in a friendly way  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Welcome to first class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to recline ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to push into a horizontal position ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can recline the seat when you sleep.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "snack ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a small amount of food ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have a snack while you wait for the meal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get used to ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become accustomed to  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I could get used to traveling first class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flight attendant ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an airline worker ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The flight attendant helps passengers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "travel kit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small set of things used for travel  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This travel kit contains hand cream and an eye mask.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Imagine you are traveling on a plane.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue making a request for something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the flight attendant's response.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2 more requests and responses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue aloud. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about air travel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make requests using words like <span class=\"italic\">can</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">would</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to requests on a plane.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}